1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,231
The Eustachian tube links the middle ear to the throat and equalises pressure, which is why your ears pop on the drive up to Muktinath.

2
00:00:09,231 --> 00:00:22,031
And the inner ear also balances you: three semicircular canals at right angles sense rotation, while the utriculus and sacculus, with their tiny stones, sense which way is up.

